<title>USA: Uroquest says names Kaiser as CFO.</title>
<headline>Uroquest says names Kaiser as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>COSTA MESA, Calif. 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uroquest Medical Corp said Tuesday it named Jeffrey Kaiser vice president, chief financial officer, treasurer and secretary, effective immediately.</p>
<p>He replaces Gregory Ayers, who will be leaving the company.</p>
<p>Kaiser was most recently vice president at EP Technologies, a division of Boston Scientific Corp.</p>
